<section class="section container container--narrow prose">
  <h1>How we choose attorneys</h1>
  <p>{{ site.name }} refers seriously injured people only to Connecticut attorneys who have been independently recognized by {{ site.ratingSource }}. We do not sell placement, and attorneys cannot buy their way onto our list.</p>
  <h2>What we look for</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Independent peer or third-party ratings at the top tier.</li>
    <li>A focus on serious personal injury and wrongful death cases.</li>
    <li>Good standing with the Connecticut bar and no recent public discipline.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>About our accident reports</h2>
  <p>Each day we review public police releases and local news reports about serious accidents in Connecticut and publish short factual summaries with links to the original sources. We never publish the names of people involved, and we never contact accident victims directly.</p>
  <p><a href="/contact/" class="btn">Get Matched Free</a></p>
</section>
